cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or the released model weights, please cite the
  paper below. To cite a specific archived version, use its Zenodo DOI.
title: >-
  BEAM3R: Beam's-eye-view architecture with Mamba-3 for implicit dose
  reconstruction
abstract: >-
  A beam's-eye-view deep-learning framework for rapid photon control-point and
  proton beamlet dose prediction, developed for the DoseRAD2026 Grand
  Challenge. BEAM3R combines a 2D CNN encoder-decoder with Mamba-3
  depth-sequence modelling and implicit super-resolution, with custom Triton
  inference kernels.
